<div role="region" aria-label="Long description for scatterplot" class="sr-only"><ul>
<li>The scatterplot has 6 data points.</li>
<li>The data points are in an exponential pattern trending down from left to right.</li>
<li>A curve of best fit is shown:<br>
<ul>
<li>The curve of best fit trends down from left to right.&nbsp;</li>
<li>The curve of best fit passes through the following approximate coordinates:<br>
