<p style="text-align: left;">At <math alttext="x equals 32"><mrow>
	<mi>x</mi>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mn>32</mn>
</mrow>
</math>, which of the following is closest to the <em>y</em>-value predicted by the line of best fit?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"125a36e7-5230-4161-96bb-d273f452c3e0","content":"<p><math alttext=\"0.4\"><mn>0.4</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"2397afc2-ee28-4316-b4c5-c211939fada2","content":"<p><math alttext=\"1.5\"><mn>1.5</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"b41e8670-147f-4aa8-b8b6-3d870b532cca","content":"<p><math alttext=\"2.4\"><mn>2.4</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"2f056d9f-40e3-4b91-a85e-afc0a92942ca","content":"<p><math alttext=\"3.3\"><mn>3.3</mn>\n</math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["C"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["b41e8670-147f-4aa8-b8b6-3d870b532cca"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p>Choice C is correct. At&nbsp;<math alttext="x equals 32"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math>, the line of best fit has a <em>y</em>-value between <math alttext="2"><mn>2</mn>
</math> and <math alttext="3"><mn>3</mn>
</math>. The only choice with a value between <math alttext="2"><mn>2</mn>
</math> and <math alttext="3"><mn>3</mn>
</math> is choice C.</p>
<p>Choice A is incorrect. This is the difference between the <em>y</em>-value predicted by the line of best fit and the actual <em>y</em>-value at <math alttext="x equals 32"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math>&nbsp;rather than the <em>y</em>-value predicted by the line of best fit at <math alttext="x equals 32"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math>.</p>
<p>Choice B is incorrect. This is the <em>y</em>-value predicted by the line of best fit at <math alttext="x equals 31"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>31</mn></math> rather than at <math alttext="x equals 32"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></math>.</p>
