<p style="text-align: left;">How many of these containers of walnuts contain exactly <math alttext="78"><mn>78</mn>
</math> walnuts?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"dcb4568e-840e-41f6-83d5-8f33970cc47a","content":"<p><math alttext=\"2\"><mn>2</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"1f287c70-24ac-415f-8a3d-ebc01c561638","content":"<p><math alttext=\"7\"><mn>7</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"f18a5f35-4a09-414a-94c8-b8ec7b3cec9c","content":"<p><math alttext=\"20\"><mn>20</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"c30936d1-4fc8-4295-8df6-744473923962","content":"<p><math alttext=\"78\"><mn>78</mn>\n</math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["B"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["1f287c70-24ac-415f-8a3d-ebc01c561638"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">Choice B is correct. The height of each bar in the graph shown represents the number of containers that contain the number of walnuts specified at the bottom of the bar. The bar for <math alttext="78"><mn>78</mn>
</math> walnuts has a height of <math alttext="7"><mn>7</mn>
</math>. Therefore, <math alttext="7"><mn>7</mn>
</math> of these containers of walnuts contain exactly <math alttext="78"><mn>78</mn>
</math> walnuts.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice A is incorrect. This is the number of containers that contain exactly <math alttext="75"><mn>75</mn>
</math> walnuts, not <math alttext="78"><mn>78</mn>
</math> walnuts.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice C is incorrect. This is the total number of containers of walnuts represented in the bar graph, not the number that contain exactly <math alttext="78"><mn>78</mn>
</math> walnuts.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice D is incorrect. This is the number of walnuts in a container that contains exactly <math alttext="78"><mn>78</mn>
</math> walnuts, not the number of containers that contain exactly <math alttext="78"><mn>78</mn>
</math> walnuts.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"fe6a49d6","external_id":"11e14767-1eaf-4adb-8d85-9e42946ce439","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":null,"uId":"244baf58-e2ce-47c1-9f51-173597672179","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"Q","domain":"Problem-Solving and Data Analysis","skill_cd":"Q.C.","skill_desc":"One-variable data: Distributions and measures of center and spread","difficulty":"E","score_band_range_cd":1,"type":"mcq","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The bar graph shows the distribution of the number of walnuts per container for <math alttext=\"20\"><mn>20</mn>\n</math> containers at a grocery store.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"380\" height=\"329.84\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 329.84\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A bar graph. The horizontal axis is labeled Number of walnuts per container. 4 bars are shown. The vertical axis is labeled Frequency. It ranges from 0 to 8 in increments of 1. Refer to long description.\"><g id=\"ed420550-79eb-48d4-af01-cd27cdd08af0\" data-name=\"Layer 1\"><defs>\n      <pattern id=\"bar4\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"10\" height=\"100\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" patternTransform=\"rotate(50)\">\n  \t\t<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"5\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#CDCDCD\"></rect>\n  \t\t<rect x=\"5\" y=\"0\" width=\"5\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#444444\"></rect>\n      </pattern>\n      </defs><line xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x1=\"69.38920402526855\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"365\" y2=\"48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"></line><line xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x1=\"63.389204025268555\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"75.38920402526855\" y2=\"48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"></line><text t