</math>, and <math alttext="upper C"><mi>C</mi>
</math> correspond to <math alttext="upper X"><mi>X</mi>
</math>, <math alttext="upper Y"><mi>Y</mi>
</math>, and <math alttext="upper Z"><mi>Z</mi>
</math>, respectively. In triangle <math alttext="upper A upper B upper C"><mrow>
	<mi>A</mi>
	<mi>B</mi>
	<mi>C</mi>
</mrow>
</math>, the length of <math alttext="line segment upper A upper B"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math> is <math alttext="170"><mn>170</mn>
</math> and the length of <math alttext="line segment upper B upper C"><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math> is <math alttext="850"><mn>850</mn>
</math>. In triangle <math alttext="upper X upper Y upper Z"><mrow>
	<mi>X</mi>
	<mi>Y</mi>
	<mi>Z</mi>
</mrow>
</math>, the length of <math alttext="line segment upper Y upper Z"><mover><mrow><mi>Y</mi><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math> is <math alttext="60"><mn>60</mn>
</math>. What is the length of <math alttext="line segment upper X upper Y"><mover><mrow><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math>?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"f316b5ac-8bc2-466c-9d8e-78bdf3f50e87","content":"<p><math alttext=\"204\"><mn>204</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"cd80f4f5-ed45-4ea1-ab4f-838db24f0ce3","content":"<p><math alttext=\"182\"><mn>182</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"043aaa10-6bdc-42c7-9e09-2ddd5f563d14","content":"<p><math alttext=\"60\"><mn>60</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"4e416e9b-503f-45ab-9d18-1e23b0a9771b","content":"<p><math alttext=\"12\"><mn>12</mn>\n</math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["D"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["4e416e9b-503f-45ab-9d18-1e23b0a9771b"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">Choice D is correct. It's given that triangle <math alttext="upper A upper B upper C"><mrow>
