<div role="region" aria-label="Long description for graph of 3 points" class="sr-only"><ul><li>From left to right, the 3 points have the following coordinates:<br>
<ul>
<li>(4 comma 8)</li>
<li>(7 comma 11)</li>
<li>(7 comma 5)</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul></div></figure></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">The three points shown define a circle. The circumference of this circle is <math alttext="k pi"><mi>k</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></math>, where <math alttext="k"><mi>k</mi>
</math> is a constant. What is the value of <math alttext="k"><mi>k</mi>
</math>?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"b5f7fb37-6aa4-4fe5-b021-5526b3667425","content":"<p><math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"0b6e3dd8-0238-406d-abad-a33497d409d6","content":"<p><math alttext=\"6\"><mn>6</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"44222e97-554c-41d1-b3da-5521522b257c","content":"<p><math alttext=\"7\"><mn>7</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"f964f77e-ce94-401c-962a-389711294ff7","content":"<p><math alttext=\"9\"><mn>9</mn>\n</math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["B"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["0b6e3dd8-0238-406d-abad-a33497d409d6"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">Choice B is correct. It’s given that the three points shown define a circle, so the center of that circle is an equal distance from each of the three points. The point <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="left parenthesis 7 comma 8 right parenthesis"><mo>(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>)</mo></math> is halfway between the points <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="left parenthesis 7 comma 5 right parenthesis"><mo>(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="left parenthesis 7 comma 11 right parenthesis"><mo>(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and is a distance of <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="3"><mn>3</mn></math> units from each of those two points. The point <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="left parenthesis 7 comma 8 right parenthesis"><mo>(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>)</mo></math> is also a distance of <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="3"><mn>3</mn></math> units from <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="left parenthesis 4 comma 8 right parenthesis"><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>)</mo></math>. Because the point <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="left parenthesis 7 comma 8 right parenthesis"><mo>(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>)</mo></math> is the same distance from all three given points, it must be the center of the circle. The radius of a circle is the distance from the center to any point on the circle. Since that distance is <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="3"><mn>3</mn></math>, it follows that the radius of the circle is <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="3"><mn>3</mn></math>. The circumference of a circle with radius <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="r"><mi>r</mi></math> is equal to <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="2 pi r"><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>r</mi></math>. It follows that the circumference of the circle is <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="2 left parenthesis pi right parenthesis left parenthesis 3 right parenthesis"><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, or <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="6 pi"><mn>6</mn><mi>π</mi></math>. It's given that the circumference of the circle is <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="k pi"><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi></math>. Therefore, the value of <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="k"><mi>k</mi></math> is <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="6"><mn>6</mn></math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice A is incorrect. This is the radius of the circle, not the value of <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="k"><mi>k</mi></math> in the expression <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="k pi"><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi></math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice C is incorrect. This is the <em>x</em>-coordinate of the center of the circle, not the value of <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="k"><mi>k</mi></math> in the expression <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="k pi"><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi></math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice D is incorrect. This is the value of <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="k"><mi>k</mi></math> for which <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="k pi"><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi></math> represents the area of the circle, in square units, not the circumference of the circle, in units.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"096c7ef5","external_id":"924fda1b-aa0e-4da6-bd05-7a55e96639dd","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":null,"uId":"1e504c4c-1eb2-48d4-9fe5-a916cfffb617","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"S","domain":"Geometry and Trigonometry","skill_cd":"S.A.","skill_desc":"Area and volume","difficulty":"M","score_band_range_cd":5,"type":"mcq","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg height=\"275.22pt\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 286.56 275.22\" width=\"286.56pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Graph of 3 points in the x y plane with the origin labeled O. The x axis ranges from 0 to 15. The y axis ranges from 0 to 15. Refer to long description.\">\n <defs>\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\n*{stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:round;}\n  </style>\n </defs>\n <g id=\"figure_1\">\n  <g id=\"patch_1\">\n   <path d=\"M 0 275.22 \nL 286.56 275.22 \nL 286.56 0 \nL 0 0 \nz\n\" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"axes_1\">\n   <g id=\"patch_2\">\n    <path d=\"M 7.2 260.46 \nL 279.36 260.46 \nL 279.36 10.98 \nL 7.2 10.98 \nz\n\" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_1\"></g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_2\"></g>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"axes_2\">\n   <g id=\"patch_3\">\n    <path d=\"M 9.200821 268.02 \nL 271.689179 268.02 \nL 271.689179 7.2 \nL 9.200821 7.2 \nz\n\" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_3\">\n    <g id=\"xtick_